2026-07-27T09:59:47.6237400Z i /tmp/Rtmp5uKN7G/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:59:47.6238060Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:59:47.6238524Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:59:47.6238918Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:59:47.6239542Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:59:47.6240471Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:59:47.6241615Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
